61
00:04:34.310 --> 00:04:38.050
Selliseid neid tahvleid me teeme
eesistumise jaoks nüüd.

62
00:04:38.150 --> 00:04:40.780
Üle üle 3000.

63
00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:42.610
Selliseid.

64
00:04:42.710 --> 00:04:45.429
Ma varem tegin Emeneid,
see oli Murges ant Accuasitions,

65
00:04:45.529 --> 00:04:47.080
mis tähendas, et

66
00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:49.989
