90
00:06:09.440 --> 00:06:11.140
Ja hetkel.

91
00:06:11.240 --> 00:06:13.870
Olen ma lapsehoolduspuhkusel.

92
00:06:13.970 --> 00:06:17.240
Sureneni advokaadibüroost, kus ma,
kus ma

